[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12664.229, "timestamp": "03:31:04", "text": "看起来你很不擅长“我的天哪”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12666.87, "timestamp": "03:31:06", "text": "我不会读的。不知道是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12669.309, "timestamp": "03:31:09", "text": "只要你享受工作，就去上班。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12680.03, "timestamp": "03:31:20", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12682.71, "timestamp": "03:31:22", "text": "是的。等等，我为什么把它删掉了？为什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12700.15, "timestamp": "03:31:40", "text": "当然，就是这样。我的天哪，她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12710.83, "timestamp": "03:31:50", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12714.229, "timestamp": "03:31:54", "text": "不，有耳机。为什么要删除？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12715.65, "timestamp": "03:31:55", "text": "我的天啊。"}]